      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofcarawayar.org/city-info"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Caraway sits in the Arkansas Delta, within the Francis Lowlands ecoregion of the larger Mississippi Alluvial Plain.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        10,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caraway%2C_Arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The flat terrain of Caraway still bears sand blows and sunken lands left by the 1811–12 New Madrid earthquakes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caraway%2C_Arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1923 Caraway was incorporated, taking its name from U.S. Senator Thaddeus Caraway.",
